This repository redistributes modified copies of five open-source driving planners, together
with an SD-route builder and the OpenStreetMap data it reads. Each project keeps its original
LICENSE file in its own directory. As required by Apache-2.0 section 4(b), the modifications
are stated below; most modified source files also carry in-line comments explaining the change.

